cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is an educational reproduction of the BPT emission-line
  diagnostic plus an unsupervised outlier search. Please cite the original
  science papers listed in REFERENCES.bib (Baldwin et al. 1981; Kauffmann et al.
  2003; Kewley et al. 2001, 2006; Brinchmann et al. 2004; Tremonti et al. 2004;
  Abdurro'uf et al. 2022) for the method and data. If you reuse this software,
  you may additionally cite it as below.
type: software
title: "bpt-diagram-sdss: BPT emission-line classification and line-ratio outlier search on SDSS (MPA-JHU) galaxies"
authors:
  - family-names: Bhadoria
    given-names: Aditya
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/adityavsb/bpt-diagram-sdss"
